entity A
entity B
entity C

noFluentMethod A
filter *
readOnly * except C
skipClient B, C
dto * with mapstruct except C
service A, B with serviceClass
pagination A with infinite-scroll
search * with elasticsearch except A
microservice A, B with store
angularSuffix A with mySuffix
clientRootFolder A with "../folder"
use mapstruct, serviceImpl, pagination for B
use couchbase for C
